# Cursor Rules for learn-css

- Use Modern CSS features (Cascade Layers, Grid, Flexbox, Container Queries, OKLCH).
- Do not use preprocessors (Sass/LESS) or utility frameworks (Tailwind) unless explicitly requested; use vanilla modern CSS.
- Ensure all tests pass with `npm test` (`vitest run`).
- Write clean TypeScript with strict type checking.
